{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find and pick up object. Move to destination, check properties, and complete task. If not visible, search area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = MoveToSearchArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObjectTask    />",
